<section class="ncs-about-page">
  <div class="ncs-about-hero-split" data-nc-reveal>
    <div class="ncs-about-hero-copy">
      <h1>Defined by <em>material</em></h1>
      <p class="ncs-about-hero-lead">Natural stone, considered form, precise finishing — objects shaped for quiet, architectural interiors.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ncs-about-hero-visual">
      <img src="{{ 'hero-marble.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Marble surface detail" width="1200" height="900" loading="eager">
    </div>
  </div>

  <blockquote class="ncs-about-quote" data-nc-reveal>
    <p>We work with stone as architects work with light — selectively, precisely, with permanence in mind.</p>
  </blockquote>

  <div class="ncs-about-pillars">
    <article class="ncs-about-pillar" data-nc-reveal>
      <span class="ncs-pillar-num">01</span>
      <div class="ncs-pillar-body">
        <h2>Material</h2>
        <p>Ibiza White, Beige Travertine, Armani Grey and Rosso Levanto are selected for tone, veining, depth and presence — never as filler, always as the defining element.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="ncs-about-pillar" data-nc-reveal>
      <span class="ncs-pillar-num">02</span>
      <div class="ncs-pillar-body">
        <h2>Proportion</h2>
        <p>Essential geometry and controlled dimensions keep every object quiet and architectural. Nothing ornamental for its own sake.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="ncs-about-pillar" data-nc-reveal>
      <span class="ncs-pillar-num">03</span>
      <div class="ncs-pillar-body">
        <h2>Precision</h2>
        <p>Edges, surfaces and transitions are treated as part of the object — not as finishing details applied at the end.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="ncs-about-pillar" data-nc-reveal>
      <span class="ncs-pillar-num">04</span>
      <div class="ncs-pillar-body">
        <h2>Surface</h2>
        <p>Each finish preserves the natural variation of stone while maintaining a refined tactile quality you can feel in the hand.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="ncs-about-pillar ncs-about-pillar--wide" data-nc-reveal>
      <span class="ncs-pillar-num">05</span>
      <div class="ncs-pillar-body">
        <h2>Made to order</h2>
        <p>Objects are produced for each order rather than held as finished stock. Every piece is considered before it is cut.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="ncs-about-cta" data-nc-reveal>
    <div class="ncs-about-cta-copy">
      <h2>Work with us</h2>
      <p>For interior designers, architects and hospitality projects seeking bespoke marble objects.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ncs-btn" href="{% render 'nc-page-url', handle: settings.page_b2b_handle, view: 'b2b' %}">B2B Enquiry ↗</a>
  </div>
</section>

